meta {
  name: 2. Confirm Payment
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/suscripciones/{{suscripcionId}}/confirmar
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
}

docs {
  Only a hint to re-read live state from Stripe — never taken as proof of payment. Calling
  this before the card was actually confirmed with Stripe just re-syncs whatever Stripe's
  current state is (still INCOMPLETA), so it is safe to call speculatively.

  This is one of two ways the sync fires; the Stripe webhook is the other. Both call the
  same idempotent syncSubscriptionFromStripe, so whichever arrives first wins.
}
